      <Desc>GPA OPERATES A PUBLIC CHARTER SCHOOL OFFERING HIGH-QUALITY EDUCATION TO STUDENTS IN GRADES 6-12. GPA IS COMMITTED TO SERVING STUDENTS WITH LOW- INCOME BACKGROUNDS WHO MAY BE THE FIRST STUDENT IN THEIR FAMILIES TO ATTEND COLLEGE AND DESIGNING AN EDUCATIONAL AND SOCIAL PROGRAM THAT WILL ALLOW ALL STUDENTS ACCESS TO A COLLEGE PATHWAY. THE SCHOOL DRAWS THE MAJORITY OF ITS STUDENTS FROM SOUTHEASTERN SAN DIEGO NEIGHBORHOODS. GPA SEEKS TO PROVIDE A HIGH QUALITY COLLEGE PREPARATORY EDUCATIONAL OPTION TO THE GOMPERS COMMUNITY AND OTHER STUDENTS WHO ARE UNDER-REPRESENTED IN COLLEGES AND UNIVERSITY SETTINGS. FOR THE YEAR ENDED JUNE 30, 2024, GPA SERVED APPROXIMATELY 1,229 STUDENTS IN GRADES 6-12.</Desc>
